ce><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離）</title> <description>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離） — Dockerfile レイヤ最適化・BuildKit キャッシュ活用・並列 dh_make・sairedis 分離ビルドの 4 手法で SONiC のビルド時間を大幅に短縮する設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-system-improvements.png" type="image/png" length="51378" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 概念（テストの目的とトポロジ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの概念・目的・トポロジ・対応 testbed を整理する。SONiC が「SRC_IP = DST_IP」のパケットを正しく L3 ルーティングできるかを sonic-mgmt の PTF / pytest で検証するテストインフラ HLD。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="31944" /> </item> <item> <title>P4RT App の Read キャッシュ（PI 形式の table_entry_cache_）</title> <description>P4RT App の Read キャッシュ（PI 形式の table_entry_cache_） — P4 Runtime (P4RT) サーバはコントローラから 3 種の操作（Stream / Write / Read）を受ける。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/p4rt-read-cache-hld.png" type="image/png" length="48684" /> </item> <item> <title>CONFIG_DB ↔ orchagent クラス対応表</title> <description>CONFIG_DB ↔ orchagent クラス対応表 — SONiC の CONFIG_DB テーブル が「誰によって読まれるか」を一望できる早見表。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db-orch-map/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db-orch-map/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db-orch-map.png" type="image/png" length="39216" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>config default-route（デフォルトルート設定パターン）</title> <description>config default-route（デフォルトルート設定パターン） — SONiC に config default-route という独立コマンドは存在しないため、用途に応じて vtysh / config route-map / frr 設定ファイル等を使い分けるパターンを解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-default-route/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-default-route.png" type="image/png" length="38024" /> </item> <item> <title>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT_FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>AUTO_TECHSUPPORT_FEATURE テーブル — AUTO_TECHSUPPORT (GLOBAL) で定義したイベント駆動 techsupport の挙動を、FEATURE (docker) 単位でオーバーライドするテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/auto-techsupport-feature.png" type="image/png" length="35077" /> </item> <item> <title>FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>FEATURE テーブル — SONiC の機能 docker（bgp、teamd、snmp、sflow、telemetry 等）の有効化、自動再起動、起動遅延、scope（global / per-asic / per-dpu）、Kubernetes 管理切り替えを保持する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/feature.png" type="image/png" length="31658" /> </item> <item> <title>コンテナが起動しない (FEATURE)</title> <description>FEATURE テーブルと hostcfgd / config feature state を起点に SONiC のコンテナが起動しない事象を切り分ける runbook。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/container-not-starting/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/container-not-starting/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/container-not-starting.png" type="image/png" length="29348" /> </item> <item> <title>EVPN Type-2 route が広告されない</title> <description>Runbook: EVPN Type-2 (MAC/IP) route が peer に広告されない原因 (advertise-all-vni 未設定 / VLAN-VNI mapping 欠落 / FDB 未学習 / RT 不整合) を sonic-frr の bgp_evpn.c と sonic-swss の vxlanorch.cpp に照らして切り分けるための runbook。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/evpn-type2-not-advertised/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/evpn-type2-not-advertised/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/evpn-type2-not-advertised.png" type="image/png" length="44032" /> </item> <item> <title>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index）</title> <description>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index） — verification: discrepancy-found が付いた全ページを monitor subtype 別に分類した一覧。meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py で生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png" type="image/png" length="41531" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-bgp-device-global YANG</title> <description>sonic-bgp-device-global YANG — デバイスレベル BGP のグローバル設定。TSA (Traffic Shift Away)、 WCMP (Weighted ECMP)、 IDF isolation 状態、および BGP confederation 設定を保持する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-device-global/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-device-global/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-bgp-device-global.png" type="image/png" length="47654" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-feature YANG</title> <description>sonic-feature YANG — SONiC service/feature enable, disable, and auto-restart control YANG module.</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-feature.png" type="image/png" length="38716" /> </item> <item> <title>Critical Resource Monitoring（CRM・SAI 表枯渇のしきい値監視）</title> <description>Critical Resource Monitoring（CRM・SAI 表枯渇のしきい値監視） — ASIC 側の各種リソース（route 表、neighbor、ACL counter、FDB、NAT 等）は ハードウェアサイズで上限がある。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/critical-resource-monitoring-in-sonic/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/critical-resource-monitoring-in-sonic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/critical-resource-monitoring-in-sonic.png" type="image/png" length="53106" /> </item> <item> <title>config-setup サービス（first-boot config 生成 / 版間 migration）</title> <description>config-setup サービス（first-boot config 生成 / 版間 migration） — SONiC の起動時設定は /etc/sonic/config_db.json に保存され、boot で Config DB に流し込まれる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-configuration-setup-service/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-configuration-setup-service/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/sonic-configuration-setup-service.png" type="image/png" length="52363" /> </item> <item> <title>VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB パイプライン</title> <description>VRF / ECMP / RIB-FIB パイプライン — SONiC の L3 転送を「VRF と interface を作る」「route が FRR から APPL_DB に来る」「orchagent が RIF / next hop / route object を ASIC に作る」「ECMP の種類を選ぶ」の順で読み直す章入口。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 21:03:32 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/04-vrf-ecmp/index.png" type="image/png" length="40127" /> </item> </channel> </rss>